{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02821","headline":"山林休日田家 · 卢照邻","name":"山林休日田家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归休乘暇日，饁稼返秋场。\n径草疏王篲，岩枝落帝桑。\n耕田虞讼寝，凿井汉机忘。\n戎葵朝委露，齐枣夜含霜。\n南涧泉初冽，东篱菊正芳。\n还思北窗下，高卧偃羲皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}